{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9dc6f2aff018c86c56d92745086165cca373f43debf839dbda038c3999eaed23", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だが、\n可憐の表情が硬い……何度かNGが出ている）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》，可是可怜的表情很僵硬……已经好几次被判定为NG了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "f21ee0a011d16a0bbea263398a8b66b0038ce3778fd943cfe4ee605fe8b150b6", "ja": "うう……す、すみません。私のせいで、\n撮影を止めてしまって……。", "zh": "呜呜……对、对不起。都怪我，让拍摄中断了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d96397b6bc4d619a97f8f2d9c234018ac969721a9c34886b62406b4cbd595283", "ja": "大丈夫、まずは落ち着こう。\nなにか気になる事でもあるのか？", "zh": "没事的，先冷静一下。\n是有什么在意的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "fd0beee7759adefc833c41761f1b38309f5bd7bd5ee6aaba9e9fa0018bc44c33", "ja": "あの……このパジャマで撮影してると、\nなんだか恥ずかしくって……。", "zh": "那个……穿着这身睡衣拍摄，总觉得有点害羞……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1004_p", "source_sha256": "09b65f9c82dd368973658368132e483035491d3e9f0934e14146a3b2e9f2eafc", "ja": "恥ずかしい？　もしかして、気に入らなかったか？\nもっと大人っぽくて、セクシーな方がよかったかな。", "zh": "害羞？难道是不喜欢吗？\n要是更成熟、更性感一点的，会不会更好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "a6a9b91a19bf9ebb83e8af4d1e8fb0a231e616c2eb706636ba48f439f4c08cca", "ja": "い、いえ！　とても素敵な衣装だと思います！\nただ、プライベートが見られている気がして……。", "zh": "不、不是！我觉得这套衣服非常漂亮！只是……总觉得自己的私生活好像被看到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "2fbc8b9639bdec166f529470031c1e7d428e459fcf2426ebf0c87af7a6f64611", "ja": "わ、私、プライベートには自信がないので……。\nうぅ……なんだか、落ち着かなくて……。", "zh": "我、我对自己的私生活没什么自信……\n呜呜……总觉得，静不下心来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1007_p", "source_sha256": "705383e27718da87429b1d0a284917e2b1778652db57f5e715c0904b39f822fd", "ja": "なるほどな……それで表情が硬くなっていたのか。", "zh": "原来如此……所以你的表情才会变得这么僵硬啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "43d61175e44013717d99ec4be0e0f42871587fbb597ea7c8b07016e4d25f0bc5", "ja": "はい……。グラビアの撮影って、ちゃんと\nわかっているんですけど……。すみません……。", "zh": "是的……我明白写真拍摄是怎么回事，只是……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4efd6bcb61f2957fe5fd32cb241a62fcd399b2bb02e5ccd5a429f16b8ca4574b", "ja": "う～ん……じゃあ、誰かになりきったり、\n演じてみたりするのはどうだ？", "zh": "嗯……那，试着代入某个人，或者演一演怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "1d2bf60252f7dd251b39dbc93bf594804a2937bb91bac47c701116600572e155", "ja": "演じる……そ、そうですね……。確かに、\n私じゃなくて、他の誰かだと思えば、大丈夫かも。", "zh": "扮演……对、对哦……确实，如果把自己当成其他人的话，说不定就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "27a9fa2ab5123c1b31e2291aa995294f1c6a4f50a87ff23f52e709e24759d241", "ja": "よし、試してみよう。まずはそうだな……例えば\nこのパジャマは誰が着てると似合うと思う？", "zh": "好，那就试试看吧。首先嘛……比如\n你觉得这件睡衣谁穿上会比较合适？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "d7d23a321a102d7f47aa439097449676770e65a333b8ac00149b223e8056e155", "ja": "え、えと……ひらひらしてて可愛いですし……\n絵本にでてくるお姫様や、あとは妖精さん、とか……。", "zh": "呃、呃……因为有飘飘的装饰，很可爱……\n像是绘本里的公主，或者精灵……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1013_p", "source_sha256": "98bfe9690af1391c23ddab97f4353c7ddbcaa16f3b34e522dd031f75b79e84f0", "ja": "お、いいじゃないか。お姫様や妖精……\nよし、じゃあ、お姫様になりきってみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "哦，不错嘛。公主和妖精……\n好，那就试试看完全把自己当成公主，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "5b5451f1cb8dbafe81648c19c8396aff5ac4fc8368c892c904fb6785b6cfff45", "ja": "お、お姫様ですか……？\nいいのかな、私がお姫様……。", "zh": "是、是公主吗……？\n真的可以吗，我来当公主……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3bfb75315cbc396af607c3e0972b0c1c0536d54e6f53c1d94e0b0db99dde8ed9", "ja": "せっかくのグラビア撮影なんだ、\n世界で一番可愛いお姫様だと思って撮影しよう！", "zh": "难得有写真拍摄，就把自己当成全世界最可爱的公主来拍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "671b51ccee21923cb1b194cbd2be5ecc80cb00c3c83f5540f9e6f19e8c122135", "ja": "せ、世界一って、さすがにそれは……で、でも、\n{$P$}さんがそう言うなら……。", "zh": "世、世界第一，这也未免太……不、不过，既然{$P$}先生这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "965253926eb6b387556882b67169771381e46b182e7edc72f2fa7473f7ced69b", "ja": "私は世界一かわいいお姫様、私は世界一かわいい\nお姫様、私は世界一かわいいお姫様！　……の、演技。", "zh": "我是世界上最可爱的公主，我是世界上最可爱的公主，我是世界上最可爱的公主！……的演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "ed7a49866fd02330783cbdda6a65cdd90a44eb7855743d24d6f20d5a8663a5f5", "ja": "よ、よーし……私、やってみます……！\nお姫様として、カメラに……う、映ってみますね……！", "zh": "好、好吧……我、我会试着去做的……！\n以公主的身份，试着……上、上镜看一看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3f9e107878934fb56321a100b4da420edfc67e5beab0e64658b8502fe9c28a16", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！\nそれじゃあ、そろそろ撮影再開しようか。", "zh": "啊，就是要有这样的气势！\n那么，我们差不多该继续拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0283_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "f98d53af83072d8c845be861c5f642c74d5bb59ec37e62122509cbead5a396c5", "ja": "は、はい……！　あ、あの……。\n「世界一可愛いわたくしに、任せておきなさい♪」", "zh": "好、好的……！那、那个……\n“全世界最可爱的我，就交给我吧♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
